{"id":"wb-6-573","name":"溪头三槐堂","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"溪头三槐堂","text":"溪头三槐堂坐落于安徽省黄山市休宁县海阳镇溪头村（原属秀阳乡），2006年被列为全国重点文物保护单位。\n三槐堂于明万历三十年（1602年）由王经天倡建，系王氏宗祠，又称王家大厅，原有三进十一开间，共约1500平方米。二十世纪五十年代最后一进被拆毁，现有两进约900余平方米，砖木结构，前、中两进之间开大天井，两侧配厅各有小天井。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%BA%AA%E5%A4%B4%E4%B8%89%E6%A7%90%E5%A0%82","revisionId":86545218,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86545218","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/2851b067d5933edac99c57e5.jpg","title":"Xitou_Sanhuaitang,_2021-09-25_05.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Xitou_Sanhuaitang,_2021-09-25_05.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e6/Xitou_Sanhuaitang%2C_2021-09-25_05.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Siyuwj","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​休宁溪头三槐堂","width":320,"height":214}}